sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.leaves.show/index)"
    participant Controller as "Employee LeaveController"
    participant Model as "LeaveRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Klik Batalkan Permohonan
    View->>Controller: DELETE /employee/leaves/{id}
    Controller->>Model: getById(id) + validasi kepemilikan
    Model->>DB: SELECT leave_request by id
    DB-->>Model: Data cuti

    alt Data valid (status pending & milik pegawai)
        Controller->>Model: delete(id)
        Model->>DB: DELETE FROM leave_requests WHERE id = ?
        DB-->>Model: Delete success
        Model-->>Controller: Permohonan dibatalkan
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi pembatalan berhasil
    else Data tidak valid (status bukan pending/id tidak ada/tidak berhak)
        Controller->>View: Back + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal membatalkan cuti
    end
